; One variable: `clip_children` is CLIP_AND_DRAW (2) on a green Polygon2D parent, against
; unit-clip-children-only.tscn. The parent now shows, and its red child, at alpha 0.5, blends over it
; inside the parent only. Where the child crosses the edge the canvas shows through, unchanged.

